WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.480
SCP-682 Vs SCP-3930. Could the patch&nbsp;
of nothingness, the true oblivion in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.920
the heart of rural Russia, finally consign the&nbsp;
nightmarish reptile to non-existence? Let’s see.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:17.200
The tissue sample from 682 was successfully&nbsp;
destroyed by being placed inside 3930.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.480
But the rest of the reptile would&nbsp;
be a little more complicated.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.840
Its body was placed into the void and ceased&nbsp;
existing. However, despite ceasing to exist, it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.640
could still be perceived and slaughtered several&nbsp;
of the guards and researchers in attendance.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.880
Thankfully, it did eventually disappear.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.920
Until 15 hours later, when it suddenly&nbsp;
manifested once again in its containment chamber,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:43.840
good as new. Of course, nobody really knows how&nbsp;
or why. We just don’t question it at this point.

